# Generated script output — never commit these.
#
# The scripts in this repository are read-only diagnostics, but several write
# their findings to a reports/ folder or export a CSV. That output contains real
# data from whichever tenant the script was run against: device names, user
# names, app inventory, failure counts and organisation-scale totals.
#
# Even when device and user names are masked, the software inventory and the
# scale of the numbers still identify the organisation. This repository is
# public, so generated output must stay local.

# Report output folders produced by the scripts
reports/
Reports/

# Ad-hoc exports (scripts commonly take -ExportCsv / -CsvPath)
*.csv

# Rendered HTML reports produced alongside the CSVs
latest-*.html
*-analysis.html
*-report.html

# Local scratch
*.log
*.tmp
